{parent=Chemistry bibliography}
{c}
{tag=Work by Victor K. La Mer}
{tag=Work by Robert H. Dinegar}

Journal of the American Chemical Society 72(11), 4847–4854 (1950), DOI 10.1021/ja01167a001. The publisher title/issue metadata and indexed original first-page discussion were inspected; direct publisher full-text retrieval was unavailable. The citation supports the historical sulfur-hydrosol <nucleation>/growth model, not a claim that it has been demonstrated for all nanoparticle syntheses.

https://pubs.acs.org/jacsat/article/72/11/4847/515295/Theory-Production-and-Mechanism-of-Formation-of

https://doi.org/10.1021/ja01167a001

